OL,3,GNEWSAControversial 177-home scheme
OL,4,Anears final stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe final details of a controversial
OL,7,Fdevelopment for a town in Derbyshire
OL,8,Fhave been submitted to planners.
OL,10,FPermission to build 177 homes off
OL,11,FChesterfield Road to the north of
OL,12,FAlfreton was approved in late 2024 by a
OL,13,Fgovernment planning inspector after
OL,14,FAmber Valley Borough Council had
OL,15,Finitially rejected the application.
OL,17,FAlmost 500 objections were raised
OL,18,Fagainst the proposal but inspector
OL,19,FWilliam Cooper overturned the council's
OL,20,FMarch 2024 decision due to the "most
OL,21,Facute national housing crisis in living
OL,22,Fmemory".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
